\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Strengthens\b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Juli 2012\par 22:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA--Peru's main stock market indexes ended lower Monday, as shares of some blue-chip companies posted gains while others declined.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's General Index fell 0.20% to end at 20,067.35.\par \par \uc2 The blue-chip Selective Index lost 0.26% to close at 29,210.07.\par \par \uc2 Tin miner \uc2 Minsur SA\uc2  (MINSURI1.VL) declined 1.22% to finish at 2.42 soles ($0.92).\par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN, BUENAVC1.Vl) ended 1.07% lower at $37.\par \par \uc2 Going the other way was base metals miner \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (SCCO), which rose 2.58% to close at $31.40.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday to buy $31 million at an average of PEN2.621 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 The sol has been gaining in recent trading sessions due to strong demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by companies to pay mid-year worker bonuses.\par \par \uc2 The sol closed stronger, at PEN2.622 per U.S. dollar, compared with PEN2.625 per dollar in the previous session.\par \par \uc2 So far this year the sol has appreciated 2.78% against the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 -Write to Ryan Dube at ryan.dube@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Subscribe to WSJ: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires}}}\uc2  [ 16-07-12 2022GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120716e87g0011f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
