\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Index Ends Weaker; Sol Strengthens\b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 April 2012\par 22:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global FX & Fixed Income News\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended weaker Thursday, on a decline in a number of blue chip shares.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's General Index declined 0.2% to end at 22,799.41.\par \par \uc2 The blue-chip Selective Index ended 0.12% lower, at 32,570.21.\par \par \uc2 Financial holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 . (BAP) weakened 0.02% to end at $129.50. It owns Peru's largest bank, Banco de Credito.\par \par \uc2 Tin miner \uc2 Minsur SA\uc2  (MINSURI1.VL) dropped 0.34% to end at 2.89 soles ($1.09).\par \par \uc2 Silver and lead miner \uc2 Volcan Compania Minera\uc2  SAA (VOLCABC1.VL)fell 0.31%, to end at PEN3.18 in heavy trade.\par \par \uc2 Heavy machinery distributor \uc2 Ferreyros SAA\uc2  (FERREYC1.VL) declined 0.68%, to end at PEN2.90.\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday to buy $158 million at an average of PEN2.6428 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has purchased about $7.7 billion. In 2011, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $3.54 billion. In 2010, it purchased $8.96 billion.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol on Thursday closed stronger, at PEN2.644 per U.S. dollar, compared with PEN2.648 per dollar in the previous session.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the sol has appreciated 1.97% against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak; Dow Jones Newswires; 51-99927 7269; peru@dowjones.com [ 04-26-12 1634ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 27   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020120426e84q00054\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
