\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Weakens\b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2012\par 21:41\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended lower on Wednesday, as the mining-heavy bourse was impacted by a decline in metal prices.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General Index closed 0.56% lower, at 23,015.47.\par \par \uc2 The blue-chip Selective Index ended 0.2% weaker, at 32,075.68.\par \par \uc2 Financial holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 . (BAP, BAP.VL) fell 0.77%, to close at $129. The company owns Peru's largest bank, Banco de Credito.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, \uc2 Deutsche Bank\uc2  said it expects Credicorp to increase loans by 18% this year, driven by strong growth from retail loans.\par \par \uc2 Base metals producer \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (SCCO, SCCO.VL) lost 2.4%, to end at $31.38, as copper prices declined.\par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN, BUENAVC1.VL) decreased 0.89%, to end at $39.15, as gold prices fell 3% on the Comex division of the \uc2 New York Mercantile Exchange\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday to buy $121 million at an average of PEN2.6702 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market. So far this year the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase more than $4 billion.\par \par \uc2 The sol closed slightly weaker at PEN2.672 per dollar, compared with PEN2.670 per dollar in the previous session.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the sol has appreciated 0.93% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 -By Ryan Dube, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-945 043 802; peru@dowjones.com [ 14-03-12 2041GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120314e83e00177\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
