\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Mixed; Sol Unchanged\b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Februar 2012\par 22:27\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global FX & Fixed Income News\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended mixed Friday, as a number of blue chip shares lost ground\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General Index closed 0.04% weaker at 22,825.87.\par \par \uc2 The blue-chip Selective Index ended 0.1% stronger at 31,535.14.\par \par \uc2 Financial holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 . (BAP) decreased 1.6% to end at $121.50. It owns Peru's largest bank, Banco de Credito.\par \par \uc2 Base metals miner \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (SCCO) lost 1.2% to end at $33.20.\par \par \uc2 Consumer goods producer \uc2 Alicorp\uc2  (ALICORC1.VL) went the other way, gaining 2.1% to end at 6.48 soles ($2.42)\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Friday to buy $42 million at an average rate of PEN2.679 to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol closed unchanged Friday at PEN2.680 to the dollar. So far this year, the sol has appreciated 0.63% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 Banco de Credito, the country's largest bank, said Friday it expects the sol to continue to appreciate this year, driven by a strong trade surplus and solid macroeconomic fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it forecasts the sol to end 2012 at PEN2.64 to the dollar, but added that this may be revised to show greater appreciation.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-99927 7269; peru@dowjones.com [ 02-24-12 1627ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 27   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020120224e82o00058\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
