\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Market  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Mixed On Weakening Investor Confidence\b0\par\par\uc2 By Prabha Natarajan   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 553 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Februar 2012\par 21:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--Emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were mixed and lacked direction Thursday as global concerns continued to weigh on investor confidence.\par \par \uc2 "There are three major global risks to watch and it is likely that global markets will await further clarification about those three before [they] can switch gear away from neutral," said Benoit Anne, head of emerging market strategy at \uc2 Societe Generale\uc2 . The events include implementation of Greece's agreement, the second long-term refinancing \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  and its impact on global markets, and the recent surge in oil prices on escalation of concerns about Iran.\par \par \uc2 The blazing rally that led to between 5% and 10% gains across emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first few weeks of this year has fizzled out, at least for now.\par \par \uc2 "Investors have switched to a wait-and-see mode, with the result that the momentum has been lost for now," Anne said. Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were listless through their trading session.\par \par \uc2 Germany's strong Ifo survey, which indicateded rising confidence in a resilient economy, buoyed investor sentiment some, as did U.S. data that showed no additional workers filed for jobless benefits last week. Currently, the South African rand and emerging European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the Czech koruna are up, the dollar having lost nearly a 1% against these \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Risk premiums on emerging market debt weakened two basis points to 367 basis points over comparable Treasury yields on the \uc2 J.P. Morgan\uc2  Emerging Market Bond Index-Global. Despite the lackluster investor sentiment, some issuers went ahead with new issuance including India's \uc2 Reliance Industries Ltd\uc2 . (500325.BY) and Brazil's third-largest bank, \uc2 Banco Bradesco SA\uc2  (BBD, BBDC4.BR).\par \par \uc2 Reliance sold a $500 million tap of its 2022 dollar bond, after a $1 billion bond earlier in the month. The offering by the energy and materials giant--India's largest company by market value--priced at 101.018 to yield 5.267%, and was more than six times oversubscribed.\par \par \uc2 Bradesco\uc2 , meanwhile, has a $1 billion bond that is expected to price at a yield of 5.75%, according to sources familiar with the deal.\par \par \uc2 In \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the euro returned to HUF289.90 against the Hungarian forint after hitting a high of HUF290.87 following a surprising poor show at a government bond auction where buyers demanded higher yield for these notes, though they bought more than the planned sale amount. However, continued inaction on the part of Hungary to fix controversial laws and escalating tensions with the European Commission have upset investors.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, both the Polish zloty and Czech koruna gained trading at PLN4.1783 and CZK25.064 against the euro, respectively, according to CQG data. The South African rand continued to have a positive run, as its budget showed a deficit of 4.6% vs. 5.5% expected by the market. The dollar weakened to ZAR7.6536 against the rand.\par \par \uc2 In Latin America, Brazil and \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw their central banks \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again. Market participants suggest that the dollar at BRL1.70 is a critical level for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 -By Prabha Natarajan, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-2468; prabha.natarajan@dowjones.com @djfxtrader\par \par \uc2 --Erin McCarthy and Diana Kinch contributed to this article. [ 23-02-12 2033GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120223e82n001b1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
