\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Weakens\b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Februar 2012\par 23:04\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock-market indexes ended lower Friday, tracking declines in international markets. The mining-heavy exchange was also affected by lower metal prices.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General Index closed 0.88% lower at 22,496.64.\par \par \uc2 The blue-chip Selective Index ended 0.87% weaker at 30,973.56.\par \par \uc2 Base-metals mining company \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (SCCO) declined 4.29% to end at $33.50, as copper prices declined. Southern Copper said Friday that it plans to produce 640,000 tons of copper in 2010.\par \par \uc2 Copper mining company Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) lost 1.24% to $38.30.\par \par \uc2 Tin miner \uc2 Minsur SA\uc2  (MINSURI1.VL) fell 1.64% to 3 soles ($1.12).\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday to buy $489 million at an average of PEN2.6851 to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market. Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the biggest so far this year.\par \par \uc2 In January, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchased $1.3 billion, followed by $770 million so far in February, not including Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The bank will continue with its policy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reduce the volatility in the exchange rate," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's chief economist, Adrian Armas, said during a conference call on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The sol closed slightly weaker Friday at PEN2.687 to the dollar compared with PEN2.686 the previous session.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the sol has appreciated 0.37% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 -By Ryan Dube, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-945 043 802; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-02-12 2204GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120210e82a001k4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
